A claim with a space before its note ^[The note.]. The sentence goes on after it, a second note ^[Another.] sits between words, and one written #note[Called by name.] as a call.

句末的脚注。^[句号之后。]也粘在标点之后，括号后的脚注（如此）^[括号之后。]同样如此。

Attached by hand: a dagger #attach('prev')[†] hugs its word, a pilcrow #attach('next')[¶] its next word, and a dot #attach('both')[·] both.
